<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <div>
        <h1>Explore the stories, photographs and film collections of <em>EXPRMNTL</em>, Knokke-le-Zoute.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">EXPRMNTL was an international festival for experimental film, founded by Jacques Ledoux and the Royal Belgian Film Archive. Held between Christmas and New Year in a vacant casino on the Belgian coast, it became one of the few places where the world's avant-garde filmmakers actually met — and, for a few years, the closest thing experimental cinema had to a capital.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell timeline" aria-label="Festival editions timeline">
    <div class="timeline-track">
      <div class="timeline-item"><a href="editions.html#1949"><span class="timeline-year">1949</span><span class="timeline-label">EXPRMNTL 1
      </span></a></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><a href="editions.html#1958"><span class="timeline-year">1958</span><span class="timeline-label">EXPRMNTL 2</span></a></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><a href="editions.html#1963"><span class="timeline-year">1963</span><span class="timeline-label">EXPRMNTL 3</span></a></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><a href="editions.html#1967"><span class="timeline-year">1967</span><span class="timeline-label">EXPRMNTL 4</span></a></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><a href="editions.html#1974"><span class="timeline-year">1974</span><span class="timeline-label">EXPRMNTL 5</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell section">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The collection</p>
        <h2 style="margin-top:12px;">Photographs, programmes, and documents — gathered in one place</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="body-copy">EXPRMNTL is regarded as an important breeding ground for experimental film: one of the few venues where avant-garde movements from across Europe and North America actually crossed paths. Beyond screenings, the festival hosted happenings, performances and — famously — its share of controversy.</p>
        <p class="body-copy">This site brings together digitized programmes, photographs, press clippings and other traces of the five editions. Most items below are placeholders: the structure is ready, and material is being added as it is digitized and catalogued.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

